{"cv":[{"lang":"협업","names":["Clare McConnell"]}],"lines":[{"t":"Appointed as Assistant","x":"Not sure if it's really me standing before you? Here's a hint: the Gemini doesn't talk.","u":null,"p":"HOME_PLACE"},{"t":"Talk 1","x":"Multitasking has never been a problem for me.","u":null,"p":"HOME_SHOW"},{"t":"Talk 2","x":"Intel is half the battle.","u":null,"p":"HOME_SHOW"},{"t":"Talk 3","x":"You need to clean your pot regularly, if you want decent coffee.","u":null,"p":"HOME_SHOW"},{"t":"Talk after Promotion 1","x":"Seeing is not always believing. Technology reveals the hidden truth.","u":{"type":"AWAKE","param":"1"},"p":"HOME_SHOW"},{"t":"Talk after Promotion 2","x":"I've encountered a few difficulties because of my appearance. No more than that, though.","u":{"type":"AWAKE","param":"2"},"p":"HOME_SHOW"},{"t":"Talk after Trust Increase 1","x":"I'll follow your lead.","u":{"type":"FAVOR","param":"40"},"p":"HOME_SHOW"},{"t":"Talk after Trust Increase 2","x":"I trust your judgment.","u":{"type":"FAVOR","param":"100"},"p":"HOME_SHOW"},{"t":"Talk after Trust Increase 3","x":"I wonder what souvenirs I'll take home from this unforgettable journey.","u":{"type":"FAVOR","param":"200"},"p":"HOME_SHOW"},{"t":"Idle","x":"Hold on, I'll be right back.","u":null,"p":"HOME_WAIT"},{"t":"Onboard","x":"Code name Iana, Team Rainbow. There's a lot of intel we can share with each other.","u":null,"p":"GACHA"},{"t":"Watching Battle Record","x":"Have you considered holographic recordings?","u":null,"p":"LEVEL_UP"},{"t":"Promotion 1","x":"A promotion? Do I get more access permissions?","u":{"type":"AWAKE","param":"1"},"p":"EVOLVE_ONE"},{"t":"Promotion 2","x":"Here's hoping this helps me reach more unexplored corners.","u":{"type":"AWAKE","param":"2"},"p":"EVOLVE_TWO"},{"t":"Added to Squad","x":"Friendly reminder, my hologram doesn't stop bullets.","u":null,"p":"SQUAD"},{"t":"Appointed as Squad Leader","x":"Gemini will show the way.","u":null,"p":"SQUAD_FIRST"},{"t":"Depart","x":"Rage against